      <p begin="01:57.350" end="02:00.650" ttm:agent="v1">But wait a minute while I make you mine, make you mine</p>
      <p begin="02:00.650" end="02:03.750" ttm:agent="v1">Tteollineun jigeumdo you're on my mind all the time</p>
      <p begin="02:03.750" end="02:08.350" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna tell you but I'm super shy, super shy</p>
